00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,580
5 words to never say in sales.

2
00:00:03,760 --> 00:00:12,040
[PAIRS - rapid fire]
Don't say sign, instead say authorize - because people authorizing

3
00:00:12,220 --> 00:00:15,560
feels like a choice, not a trap.

4
00:00:15,740 --> 00:00:22,120
Don't say contract, instead say agreement - agreements are mutual, contracts feel

5
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:24,220
one-sided.

6
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:31,100
Don't say cheap, instead say affordable - affordable feels smart, cheap feels risky.

7
00:00:31,280 --> 00:00:37,880
